\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I Bless the Christ of God;
\par I rest on love divine;
\par And with unfaltering lip and heart,
\par I call the Saviour mine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. His Cross dispels each doubt:
\par I bury in His tomb
\par Each thought of unbelief and fear,
\par Each lingering shade of gloom.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I praise the God of grace;
\par I trust His truth and might;
\par He calls me His, I call Him mine;
\par My God, my joy, my light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. In Him is only good,
\par In me is only ill;
\par My ill but draws His goodness forth,
\par And me He loveth still.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. 'Tis He who saveth  me,
\par And freely pardon gives;
\par I love because He loveth me,
\par I live because He lives.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. My life with Him is hid,
\par My death has passed away,
\par My clouds have melted into light,
\par My midnight into day.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

